<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: kiiro merchant cash register -->
  <Kiiro_Cashier.label>绮罗商户收银台</Kiiro_Cashier.label>
  <!-- EN: Where Kiiro Merchant trades.\n\nOnly placed indoors without any other cash registers. Binding merchant makes the room corresponding shop.\n\n After binding, assign a non-merchant colonist to interact with the bound merchant with right click on the cash register.\n\n Can be placed on a table. -->
  <Kiiro_Cashier.description>绮罗商户们交易和结算的地方。\n\n只能放置在没有其他收银台的室内，放置后绑定绮罗商户可以使这个房间变成商户对应的商铺类型。\n\n绑定完成后，选中非商户的殖民者右键收银台可以与绑定的商户互动。\n\n可以放置在桌面。</Kiiro_Cashier.description>
  <!-- EN: Bind a merchant. -->
  <Kiiro_Cashier.comps.CompAssignableToPawn_KiiroMerchant.noAssignablePawnsDesc>需要指定一个绮罗商户。</Kiiro_Cashier.comps.CompAssignableToPawn_KiiroMerchant.noAssignablePawnsDesc>
  
</LanguageData>